WEBVTT

00:07.793 --> 00:09.034
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.103 --> 00:10.827
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.206
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.275 --> 00:14.310
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.379 --> 00:17.275
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.344 --> 00:19.379
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.448 --> 00:21.379
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.448 --> 00:23.275
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.344 --> 00:24.965
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.034 --> 00:27.413
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.482 --> 00:29.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.275 --> 00:31.344
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.413 --> 00:33.379
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.241
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.310 --> 00:37.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.448 --> 00:39.482
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.551 --> 00:40.827
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.896 --> 00:42.689
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.758 --> 00:45.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.310 --> 00:47.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.793 --> 00:49.379
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.931 --> 00:54.862
[country banjos]
[乡村班卓琴]

00:54.931 --> 01:02.172
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:02.896 --> 01:04.448
[horn honks]
- [growls]
[喇叭鸣响]
- [咆哮]

01:04.517 --> 01:06.344
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

01:06.413 --> 01:07.448
[growls]
[咆哮]

01:07.517 --> 01:08.931
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

01:09.000 --> 01:11.172
- Oh, Boy!
Road Trip!
- 哦，男孩！
公路旅行！

01:11.241 --> 01:13.068
I hope it lasts forever.
我希望它永远持续下去。

01:13.137 --> 01:15.241
- And we're here.
- 我们到了。

01:17.620 --> 01:19.793
- Old man Jenkins' farm?
- 老詹金斯的农场？

01:19.862 --> 01:21.241
- [grumbles]
- [grunts]
- [抱怨]
- [咕哝]

01:21.310 --> 01:23.862
- Trespassers!
[both scream]
- 侵入者！
[两人尖叫]

01:23.931 --> 01:26.758
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

01:26.827 --> 01:29.000
- Ahhhhhhhh.
- 啊啊啊啊。

01:31.793 --> 01:34.103
- Whoa there Jenkins.
- 哇，詹金斯。

01:34.172 --> 01:35.379
Pull in your plow.
把你的犁拉起来。

01:35.448 --> 01:37.310
I'm here to pay
my grocery bill.
我是来付钱的
我的杂货账单。

01:37.379 --> 01:39.724
Jenkins here supplies
all the Krusty Krab's
詹金斯这里供应
所有的蟹堡王

01:39.793 --> 01:41.862
farm fresh ingredients.
- Ooh. [laughs]
农场新鲜食材。
- 哦。 [笑]

01:41.931 --> 01:44.000
Yoo-hoo!
Whee!
哟吼！
哎哟！

01:44.068 --> 01:46.655
- And I expect
to be paid for them.
- 我期望
为他们付出代价。

01:46.724 --> 01:49.034
- Well funny you
should mention that.
- 好有趣的你
应该提到这一点。

01:49.103 --> 01:51.586
SpongeBob here will
be your farm hand
海绵宝宝在这里会
成为你的农场帮手

01:51.655 --> 01:53.689
until me bill's paid off.
直到我还清账单。

01:53.758 --> 01:56.413
- Farm hand!
Oh Boy!
- 农场手！
哦男孩！

01:56.482 --> 01:59.241
- Dagnabbit!
If you think you can--
-该死！
如果你认为你可以——

01:59.310 --> 02:01.206
- Oh, look at the time.
Gotta Go!
- 哦，看看时间。
必须走！

02:01.275 --> 02:03.655
Hey, boy-o...
嘿，小伙子……

02:03.724 --> 02:06.896
this should help you
with your work!
这应该对你有帮助
与你的工作！

02:06.965 --> 02:09.551
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:09.620 --> 02:12.172
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:12.241 --> 02:15.068
- Huh? Potatoes?
- 啊？土豆？

02:15.137 --> 02:17.965
- [yelps]
- Pat-tatoes!
- [尖叫声]
- 土豆！

02:18.034 --> 02:21.241
- Oh, Boy!
We can be farming buddies.
- 哦，男孩！
我们可以成为农业伙伴。

02:21.310 --> 02:23.655
- Now hold on there, youngin'.
- 现在坚持住，年轻人。

02:23.724 --> 02:27.896
I can't just let any
dern fools work on my farm.
我不能让任何
现代傻瓜在我的农场工作。

02:27.965 --> 02:31.068
- Oh, we're not
just any dern' fools.
- 哦，我们不是
只是所有的傻瓜。

02:31.137 --> 02:33.724
- We're certified fools.
- 我们是公认的傻瓜。

02:33.793 --> 02:35.413
- Hm.
- 嗯。

02:35.482 --> 02:38.137
Well, better hitch
up your britches.
嗯，更好的挂钩
掀起你的裤子。

02:38.206 --> 02:40.413
Cause we got tons
of chores to git done
因为我们有很多
完成的家务事

02:40.482 --> 02:42.344
before the big
barn dance tonight!
在大之前
今晚谷仓舞会！

02:42.413 --> 02:44.172
[together]
Yee-haw.
[一起]
呀呀。

02:44.241 --> 02:47.448
[both giggle and shout]
[既咯咯笑又喊]

02:50.103 --> 02:52.000
[clucking]
[咯咯笑]

02:52.068 --> 02:53.793
- Oh, boy.
What's first?
- 哦，男孩。
首先是什么？

02:53.862 --> 02:57.172
- First thing we do
is gatherin' pearly eggs
- 我们做的第一件事
正在收集珍珠蛋

02:57.241 --> 02:59.931
from this oyster
coop right here.
来自这个牡蛎
合作社就在这里。

03:00.000 --> 03:02.241
The trick
is getting them oysters
窍门
给他们买牡蛎

03:02.310 --> 03:04.482
to open up their clams.
打开他们的蛤蜊。

03:05.379 --> 03:08.517
Coochie coochie coo.
- [laughing]
咕咕咕咕。
- [笑]

03:08.586 --> 03:11.413
- Ooh, shiny.
- Ooh, aww.
- 哦，闪亮的。
- 哦，哇。

03:11.482 --> 03:14.241
- I'll be back in two shakes
of a lamprey's tale
- 我会在两次震动后回来
七鳃鳗的故事

03:14.310 --> 03:16.655
to see how you're coming along.
看看你进展如何。

03:16.724 --> 03:18.068
[both chuckle]
[两人都笑了]

03:18.137 --> 03:20.137
- Uh, coochie coo--coochie...
- 呃，咕咕咕——咕咕……

03:20.206 --> 03:21.482
- [grunts]
Uh-uh.
- [咕哝]
呃呃。

03:21.551 --> 03:23.103
- Okay, that didn't work.
- 好吧，那没用。

03:23.172 --> 03:26.827
- SpongeBob,
you gotta be more gentle.
- 海绵宝宝，
你要更温柔一点。

03:26.896 --> 03:29.275
[manic screaming]
[狂躁的尖叫声]

03:29.344 --> 03:32.551
[straining]
[紧张]

03:34.137 --> 03:37.172
- Ahhhhhhh!
- 啊啊啊啊！

03:37.241 --> 03:39.241
- Patrick!
- [warbling]
- 帕特里克！
- [颤音]

03:39.310 --> 03:42.517
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

03:44.206 --> 03:45.517
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:45.586 --> 03:48.620
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:49.931 --> 03:52.793
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

03:54.724 --> 03:58.448
- Why, you ain't
gathered up a single egg!
- 为什么，你不是
收集了一个鸡蛋！

03:58.517 --> 04:01.206
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:01.275 --> 04:02.758
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:02.827 --> 04:04.862
Well, that was egg-citing.
嗯，那是鸡蛋引用。

04:04.931 --> 04:06.965
[laughs]
[笑]

04:07.034 --> 04:11.034
- The next chore is
to feed the worm hogs.
- 下一个任务是
去喂虫猪。

04:11.103 --> 04:14.793
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:15.965 --> 04:17.137
[bell tinkling]
[铃声响起]

04:17.206 --> 04:19.448
[hogs oinking]
[猪叫声]

04:21.965 --> 04:24.655
- Mmm. Slop.
- 嗯。斜坡。

04:24.724 --> 04:27.758
- [squeaking]
- [吱吱声]

04:30.862 --> 04:34.931
- Aww. Are you hungry-wungry
cutie-wutie hoggy-woggy?
- 哇。你饿了么
可爱的乌蒂 hoggy-woggy？

04:37.241 --> 04:39.758
[laughter]
That tickles.
[笑声]
那很痒。

04:39.827 --> 04:41.310
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:41.379 --> 04:45.344
[screaming]
[尖叫]

04:45.413 --> 04:48.482
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

04:48.551 --> 04:50.689
- Um, could somebody
hand me those?
- 嗯，有人可以吗
递给我那些？

04:50.758 --> 04:52.310
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

04:52.379 --> 04:54.931
[upbeat country music]
[欢快的乡村音乐]

04:55.000 --> 04:58.413
Now, you be gentle
when you milk ol' Bessie.
现在，你要温柔一点
当你给贝西挤奶时。

04:58.482 --> 05:00.655
- [moos]
- Don't you worry.
- [哞哞]
- 别担心。

05:00.724 --> 05:03.758
I'll take it easy peasy
on the old jelly squeezy.
我会轻松一点
在老果冻上挤。

05:03.827 --> 05:06.758
[hums, grunts]
[哼哼声、咕哝声]

05:06.827 --> 05:08.206
Hmm.
[grunts]
唔。
[咕哝]

05:08.275 --> 05:09.931
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:10.000 --> 05:13.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:15.655 --> 05:17.931
- [moos]
- [grunts]
- [哞哞]
- [咕哝]

05:18.000 --> 05:19.241
[strains]
[菌株]

05:19.310 --> 05:22.206
[shouts]
- [moos angrily]
[喊叫]
- [愤怒地哞哞叫]

05:22.275 --> 05:23.379
- What in tarnation--
- 塔尼翁什么的——

05:23.448 --> 05:26.000
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

05:26.068 --> 05:29.275
- [mooing angrily]
- [愤怒地呻吟]

05:30.275 --> 05:31.862
[both gulp]
[两人都咽了一口]

05:31.931 --> 05:34.310
[both shout]
[两人大喊]

05:35.965 --> 05:39.758
- Mmm, a Jenkin
Jelly sandwich.
- 嗯，詹金
果冻三明治。

05:43.103 --> 05:47.275
- Your final chore is
harvesting my kelp patch.
- 你最后的家务是
收获我的海带片。

05:47.344 --> 05:49.034
- Ha, this will be a snap.
- 哈，这会很简单。

05:49.103 --> 05:51.172
- Not that patch--
- 不是那个补丁--

05:51.241 --> 05:52.344
that one!
那个！

05:52.413 --> 05:54.137
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:54.206 --> 05:58.413
That'll take forever.
- Not if you use my tractor.
那将需要永远。
- 如果你用我的拖拉机就不会。

05:58.482 --> 06:01.551
- But I don't have
a tractor license.
- 但我没有
拖拉机执照。

06:01.620 --> 06:03.965
- I got lots of licenses.
- 我有很多许可证。

06:04.034 --> 06:08.793
Driver's license, fishing
license, marriage license.
驾驶执照、钓鱼
许可证，结婚证。

06:08.862 --> 06:11.827
- Oh, here it is.
Tractor license.
- 哦，在这儿。
拖拉机执照。

06:14.827 --> 06:17.482
- Wow Patrick.
You're really good at this.
- 哇帕特里克。
你真的很擅长这个。

06:17.551 --> 06:21.896
- The secret is to stay
cool as a sea cucumber.
- 秘诀就是留下来
像海参一样凉爽。

06:21.965 --> 06:23.551
- I don't let
anything distract--
- 我不让
任何分散注意力的事情——

06:23.620 --> 06:25.206
[shouts]
A bee!
[喊叫]
一只蜜蜂！

06:25.275 --> 06:26.275
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:26.344 --> 06:29.620
Jelly-Bee!
[babbles]
果冻蜂！
[胡言乱语]

06:29.689 --> 06:31.448
Get it off,
get it off, get it off!
把它脱下来，
脱下来，脱下来！

06:31.517 --> 06:34.137
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:34.206 --> 06:36.344
- [whimpers]
- Hold on, buddy.
- [呜咽]
- 坚持住，伙计。

06:37.793 --> 06:39.241
I got it.
我得到了它。

06:39.310 --> 06:40.793
Hyah.
哈。

06:40.862 --> 06:42.448
Whoops.
哎呀。

06:43.413 --> 06:44.413
Got it.
知道了。

06:44.482 --> 06:46.793
- Yay.
Don't let it go.
- 耶。
不要放开它。

06:46.862 --> 06:48.275
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:48.344 --> 06:49.724
[exclaims]
[惊呼]

06:49.793 --> 06:51.517
[shouts]
[喊叫]

06:51.586 --> 06:53.448
Hey, this is fun.
嘿，这很有趣。

06:53.517 --> 06:55.931
[grunts, warbles]
[咕哝声、颤音]

06:56.000 --> 06:59.000
[laughing]
[笑]

06:59.827 --> 07:01.586
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

07:02.931 --> 07:06.586
[electricity crackles]
[screaming]
[电流爆裂声]
[尖叫]

07:06.655 --> 07:08.000
[grinding]
- Whoa.
[研磨]
- 哇哦。

07:08.068 --> 07:09.896
Oh.
哦。

07:15.137 --> 07:16.724
- Did I 'bail' out to soon?
- 我很快就“保释”了吗？

07:16.793 --> 07:18.551
[laughs]
[笑]

07:18.620 --> 07:21.137
Oh, boy.
Our chores are all done.
哦，男孩。
我们的家务事都做完了。

07:21.206 --> 07:22.793
It's time for the...
是时候...

07:22.862 --> 07:25.137
[together]
Barn dance!
[一起]
谷仓舞！

07:25.206 --> 07:27.000
[engine rumbling]
[发动机轰鸣]

07:27.068 --> 07:28.689
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:28.758 --> 07:30.068
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:30.137 --> 07:34.827
How can we have a barn dance
with no barn?
我们怎样才能举办谷仓舞会
没有谷仓？

07:34.896 --> 07:36.034
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:36.103 --> 07:38.068
- Don't you worry
your little wrinkly head.
- 你不用担心
你那满是皱纹的小脑袋。

07:38.137 --> 07:42.689
'Cause we're gonna have
an old fashioned barn raising.
因为我们将会有
老式谷仓饲养

07:42.758 --> 07:44.344
[barn baby giggles]
[谷仓婴儿咯咯地笑]

07:44.413 --> 07:46.413
[barn baby fusses]
[谷仓婴儿大惊小怪]

07:46.482 --> 07:49.275
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

07:49.344 --> 07:52.103
[light music]
[轻音乐]

07:52.172 --> 07:55.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:55.655 --> 07:58.379
Aww, wee, wee, wee.
- [giggles]
哇，呜呜呜。
- [咯咯笑]

07:58.448 --> 08:00.103
- Coochie coochie coo.
- 咕咕咕咕。

08:00.172 --> 08:02.000
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

08:04.551 --> 08:06.517
[together]
Aww.
[一起]
哇。

08:06.586 --> 08:08.620
- "'A' is for Amoeba.
- “‘A’代表阿米巴原虫。

08:08.689 --> 08:11.137
B is for Blobfish."
B 代表水滴鱼。”

08:11.206 --> 08:14.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:14.586 --> 08:17.827
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

08:19.448 --> 08:20.586
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:20.655 --> 08:23.551
Oh!
You dang kids!
哦！
你们这些该死的孩子！

08:23.620 --> 08:25.827
- Congratulations
on your barn-mitzvah.
- 恭喜
在你的谷仓成人礼上。

08:25.896 --> 08:28.275
Today you are a man--barn.
今天你是一个男人——谷仓。

08:28.344 --> 08:29.655
- Mazel tov!
- 马泽尔托夫！

08:29.724 --> 08:31.965
- Aw, they grow up so fast.
- 噢，他们长得真快。

08:32.034 --> 08:33.551
[blows raspberry]
[吹覆盆子]

08:33.620 --> 08:38.172
[fiddle music]
[小提琴音乐]

08:38.241 --> 08:39.275
[disco music playing]
[迪斯科音乐播放]

08:39.344 --> 08:41.172
- [moos]
- [哞哞]

08:41.241 --> 08:43.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:43.103 --> 08:44.275
- Perfect.
- 完美的。

08:44.344 --> 08:45.551
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:45.620 --> 08:47.793
- Hey Patrick.
You know what time it is?
- 嘿帕特里克。
你知道现在几点了吗？

08:48.793 --> 08:51.517
- Time to put on my ham boots?
- 是时候穿上我的火腿靴了？

08:51.586 --> 08:53.827
- [squealing]
- [尖叫声]

08:53.896 --> 08:54.931
- Nope.
- 没有。

08:55.000 --> 08:58.206
It's time to partay!
- [shouts]
聚会的时间到了！
- [喊叫]

08:58.275 --> 09:00.241
[grunts]
Hmm?
[咕哝]
嗯？

09:01.586 --> 09:03.137
Where is everybody?
大家都在哪里？

09:03.206 --> 09:04.931
- When are your other guests
coming old man Jenkins?
- 您的其他客人什么时候来
老詹金斯来了？

09:05.000 --> 09:07.931
- Hmm?
What do you mean?
- 唔？
你是什​​么意思？

09:08.000 --> 09:11.724
This is the biggest
turnout I've ever had.
这是最大的
我曾经有过的投票率。

09:11.793 --> 09:15.310
[dramatic tone]
[both warbling]
[戏剧性的语气]
[双方都颤抖]

09:15.379 --> 09:18.310
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

09:18.379 --> 09:25.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:28.931 --> 09:32.206
- Oh, I think
the party's over.
- 哦，我想
聚会结束了。

09:35.758 --> 09:40.206
- Over?
Why, it's just getting started.
- 超过？
为什么，一切才刚刚开始。

09:40.275 --> 09:42.862
[fiddling]
[摆弄]

09:42.931 --> 09:46.068
[all chattering and cheering]
[大家的议论声和欢呼声]

09:46.137 --> 09:49.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:49.793 --> 09:52.931
- [singing gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

09:53.000 --> 10:00.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:03.206 --> 10:05.034
- How did you guys
know about the barn dance?
- 你们怎么样
你知道谷仓舞吗？

10:05.103 --> 10:07.689
- Well, we seen
your invitation.
- 嗯，我们看到了
你的邀请。

10:07.758 --> 10:09.931
- Invitation?
What invitation?
- 邀请？
什么邀请？

10:10.000 --> 10:11.137
Hmm?
唔？

10:11.206 --> 10:13.068
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

10:13.137 --> 10:14.620
Wow.
哇。

10:14.689 --> 10:17.034
[Patrick screaming]
[帕特里克尖叫]

10:18.517 --> 10:22.310
- "Barn dance
and hoedown tonight.
- 《谷仓舞》
今晚还有锄地。

10:22.379 --> 10:24.862
Aliens welcome."
欢迎外星人。”

10:24.931 --> 10:28.172
- Patrick, your crazy
tractor driving invited them.
- 帕特里克，你疯了
拖拉机驾驶邀请了他们。

10:28.241 --> 10:31.620
- I have a crop
circle license too.
- 我有庄稼
也有圈子许可证。

10:31.689 --> 10:34.000
[whirring]
[呼呼]

10:34.068 --> 10:37.103
- Thank you kindly
for inviting us, old timer.
- 亲切地谢谢你
邀请我们了，老朋友。

10:37.172 --> 10:41.241
Well, we're off
to destroy the universe.
嗯，我们出发了
毁灭宇宙。

10:41.310 --> 10:43.310
[all]
Yee-haw!
[全部]
呀呀！

10:43.379 --> 10:45.275
[all exclaiming]
[所有人惊呼]

10:45.344 --> 10:49.103
- [chuckles] Y'all come back
and invade any time.
- [轻笑]你们都回来吧
并随时入侵。

10:49.172 --> 10:51.241
- Annihilate safely.
- 安全歼灭。

10:51.310 --> 10:54.000
[all laugh and cheer]
[大家欢笑和欢呼]

10:54.068 --> 10:55.655
all: Yee-haw!
全体：呀呀！

10:55.724 --> 10:57.068
[SpongeBob giggles]
[海绵宝宝咯咯笑]

10:57.137 --> 10:58.482
[sighs]
[叹气]

10:58.551 --> 10:59.931
- Hey-ho, Jenkins.
- 嘿嘿，詹金斯。

11:00.000 --> 11:02.413
Has SpongeBob worked
off me bill yet?
海绵宝宝工作了吗
还没给我账单吗？

11:02.482 --> 11:04.758
- You're all paid off, Krabs.
- 你们都得到了回报，蟹蟹。

11:04.827 --> 11:07.793
Now come back and
visit anytime, SpongeBob.
现在回来
随时来访，海绵宝宝。

11:07.862 --> 11:10.413
- [Both]
Bye, old man Jenkins!
- [两者]
再见，老詹金斯！

11:10.482 --> 11:13.206
- Then we gathered pearly eggs,
fed the worm-hogs,
- 然后我们收集了珍珠蛋，
喂虫猪，

11:13.275 --> 11:16.862
milked Bessie, and then we
met some nice space aliens.
给贝西挤奶，然后我们
遇到了一些不错的外星人。

11:16.931 --> 11:19.689
- Aliens?
That's ridiculous.
- 外星人？
这太荒谬了。

11:19.758 --> 11:22.034
I think you've been
working too hard boy-o.
我想你已经
工作太辛苦了，男孩。

11:22.103 --> 11:24.275
Looks like you got farm stroke.
看起来你得了农场中风。

11:24.344 --> 11:26.793
You must have
been hallucinating.
你必须有
产生了幻觉。

11:26.862 --> 11:29.655
There ain't no
such thing as UFOs.
没有一个
诸如不明飞行物之类的东西。

11:29.724 --> 11:31.551
- Gee, you think we
just imagined it?
- 哎呀，你以为我们
只是想象吗？

11:31.620 --> 11:33.482
- Yeah, probab--
[screaming]
- 是的，可能--
[尖叫]

11:33.551 --> 11:35.689
A UFO!
不明飞行物！

11:35.758 --> 11:39.172
- Don't worry Mr. Krabs, there
is no such thing as aliens.
- 别担心，蟹老板，在那里
根本不存在外星人这样的东西。

11:39.241 --> 11:47.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:51.137 --> 11:54.068
[placid ukulele music]
[平静的尤克里里音乐]

11:54.137 --> 12:01.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

